  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>戒指（需同调）</em></p>\n<p>着装该戒指时，你获得对某种类型伤害的抗性。戒指上镶嵌的宝石种类决定抗性的种类，具体由DM决定或随机选择。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong> [[/r d10]] </strong></th>\n<th><strong> 伤害类型 </strong></th>\n<th><strong> 宝石 </strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.7F1258BC9D2193D8]{强酸}</td>\n<td>珍珠pearl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.3CE7EC266DE4FA80]{冷冻}</td>\n<td>电气石tourmaline</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.63256B05CF195553]{火焰}</td>\n<td>石榴石garnet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.BAA6D60FCF6D4F3B]{力场}</td>\n<td>蓝宝石sapphire</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.39DC4B8FD23549F3]{闪电}</td>\n<td>黄水晶citrine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.DF85416B0ECD6EA8]{黯蚀}</td>\n<td>黑玉jet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.84D673A61CAFED0D]{毒素}</td>\n<td>紫晶amethyst</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.C4633399A6D5BA78]{心灵}</td>\n<td>翡翠jade</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.9310DD39F7608B51]{光耀}</td>\n<td>黄玉topaz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.itempack.69D3E42F5C4D1897]{雷鸣}</td>\n<td>尖晶石spinel</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
